descriptionByLocale.en:
Pemsa is the leading Swiss employment agency specialized in research and selection of qualified personnel in the fields of construction, civil engineering, electricity, building technology and industry. Our excellence is based on a deep technical knowledge of the required profiles and a strong presence in the Swiss market. We offer tailor-made solutions that enhance professional skills, promoting a dynamic working environment and supporting the growth of candidates and partner companies. With Pemsa, the professional path becomes a shared success project, thanks to a network of qualified contacts and an approach oriented to excellence and satisfaction of every client and candidate. Missione:
• Manage with competence technical design projects using AutoCAD, ensuring the precision and efficiency in the realization of technical drawings;
• Collaborate closely with multidisciplinary teams in the field of construction, civil genius, electricity, building technique and industry to ensure compliance with Swiss standards;
• Put to fruit at least 5 years of work experience gained in Switzerland in the technical field, enhancing the adaptation and the deep knowledge of the local market. Profile:
• Experience: minimum 5 years of professional activity in Switzerland, preferably in the field of technical and engineering design with competent use of AutoCAD;
• Technical knowledge: advanced mastery of AutoCAD and ability to apply technical regulations in the Swiss construction, civil and industrial sector;
• Language: Italian spoken and written at native level, indispensable to ensure clear and punctual technical communication with teams and customers;
• Mobility: availability to move daily with a maximum radius of 25 km from your residence for
• Title: certified technical training, preferably AFC (Federal Capacity Certificate) in the field of the reference sector, considered as an added value;
• Experience in Switzerland: consolidated knowledge of the Swiss labour and regulatory fabric, which is considered a preferential qualification for the role. Ton interlocuteur/trice: Our team of experienced consultants follows with dedication every stage of the recruitment process, ensuring personalized and professional support. We offer a constant accompaniment in the professional path, enhancing the technical skills and personal aspirations of the candidates. By joining the Pemsa network, you will enjoy exclusive opportunities in the leading Swiss companies, in an environment that promotes innovation and continuous development. Nous ne répondrons qu.aux candides dont le profil...

