• Perform electrical connections in newly built and refurbished construction sites;
• Make changes and adjustments to the electrical panels;
• Act on the plants related to heat pumps (PAC);
• Build the CA systems of photovoltaic systems;
• Participate in the commissioning of the plants;
• Provide timely support on the DC part of the photovoltaic systems;
• Work in autonomous way, while working effectively with teams on the field. And now we're talking about you?
• In possession of an AFC (Federal capacity attestation) as an electrician installer or a training deemed equivalent
• patente of indispensable driving
• Bought experience in electrical connections, electric panels, heat pumps and photovoltaic systems in Switzerland
• Self-employed person, organized and attentive to the quality of the work done
• Good team spirit, sense of responsibility and proactive attitude Your contact person: Your contact person for this position is Laetitia. It will follow you, give you advice and answer all your position questions. This position does not exactly match what you are looking for, but our values interest you? Do not hesitate to send us your spontaneous application! We will only answer applications whose profile corresponds to the description you have requested.

